Reason: keys give full stick deflection and HALF_TILT (50 raw) still reads about 0.93 after the dead zone, so Wind Waker's telescope (saturating at 70% tilt) turns at full speed. FINE_TILT (default left Alt, SMS_FINE_TILT percent, default 25) tilts the stick only slightly while held: measured stick 0.46 and telescope turn rate 17.5% of full, making the postbox/Quill telescope step aimable from the keyboard.

